{
  "version": "0.1",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Block Breaker machine GUI prototype",
    "description": "Original machine-screen composition authored with Pixel Art Skill Toolkit. Status and control states are illustrative; machine behavior, FE cost, output-slot count, exact dimensions, and final control semantics are undecided.",
    "design_references": [
      { "source": "IE Item Batcher screen: separated filter/buffer zones and compact mode controls.", "url": "https://github.com/BluSunrize/ImmersiveEngineering/blob/583a182549d284a35c813b55ac2a0d1fddcf945a/src/main/java/blusunrize/immersiveengineering/client/gui/ItemBatcherScreen.java" },
      { "source": "IE Arc Furnace screen: visible per-input progress and compact energy meter.", "url": "https://github.com/BluSunrize/ImmersiveEngineering/blob/583a182549d284a35c813b55ac2a0d1fddcf945a/src/main/java/blusunrize/immersiveengineering/client/gui/ArcFurnaceScreen.java" },
      { "source": "IE EnergyInfoArea: 7x46 logical pixels and an IF hover readout.", "url": "https://github.com/BluSunrize/ImmersiveEngineering/blob/583a182549d284a35c813b55ac2a0d1fddcf945a/src/main/java/blusunrize/immersiveengineering/client/gui/info/EnergyInfoArea.java" },
      { "source": "IE RedstoneConnectorScreen: input/output selection and discrete redstone-channel controls.", "url": "https://github.com/BluSunrize/ImmersiveEngineering/blob/583a182549d284a35c813b55ac2a0d1fddcf945a/src/main/java/blusunrize/immersiveengineering/client/gui/RedstoneConnectorScreen.java" }
    ],
    "prototype_notes": [
      "The 176x166 logical canvas is a prototype choice, not an adopted requirement.",
      "Breaking status, progress fill, redstone enable control, rear item-output marker, and bottom FE-input marker are visual proposals only.",
      "The 7x46 energy well is a visual reference; FE cost tied to block hardness has no selected formula or value.",
      "One machine drop tile is illustrative; the final machine output-slot count is undecided.",
      "The lower 27-slot player grid plus hotbar follows the conventional vanilla layout and is not a machine-slot count.",
      "All shapes, palette values, and 3x5 label glyphs are original; no IE texture artwork was copied."
    ]
  },
